hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"7","Ibrahim bin Yusuf Al-Sayrifi Al-Kufi narrated to us, Ibn Idris narrated to us, on the authority of Abu Malik Al-Ashja’i, on the authority of Abu Hazim, he said: I saw Abu Kitten was performing ablution, so he started performing the ablution close to his armpit, so I told him, and he said: I heard the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, He says: “The jewelery reaches the places of purification.”"
